      "id": "dev-doc-1", "name": "API v2 spec.pdf", "kind": "Spec", "color": "#4285F4",
      "pages": 42, "size": "2.4 MB", "updated": "today, 09:12",
      "scanned": false, "signed": false, "filled": false, "redacted": false, "ocr": false, "annotated": false,
      "summary": [
        "Version 2 moves from page-based pagination (page) to cursors (cursor).",
        "The customer_name field is renamed to customer_full_name.",
        "Every request must send the header X-Api-Version: 2.",
        "Version 1 will be shut down on 31 March 2027."
      ],
      "changes": [
        { "type": "-", "text": "GET /v1/orders?page=2&per_page=50" },
        { "type": "+", "text": "GET /v2/orders?cursor=eyJpZCI6NTB9&limit=50" },
        { "type": "-", "text": "\"customer_name\": \"Ana Ilić\"" },
        { "type": "+", "text": "\"customer_full_name\": \"Ana Ilić\"" }
      ],
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "letterhead", "org": "Nimbus Labs", "sub": "Internal documentation · Platform team" },
        { "type": "title", "text": "Orders API v2 · Specification" },
        { "type": "meta", "items": [
          { "label": "Version", "value": "2.0.0-rc3" },
          { "label": "Status", "value": "In review" },
          { "label": "Author", "value": "Marko Petrović" },
          { "label": "Updated", "value": "7 November 2026" }
        ] },
        { "type": "h2", "text": "1. Pagination" },
        { "type": "p", "text": "Version 2 uses cursor pagination. The response contains next_cursor, and the client sends it in the next request until it gets null. The page and per_page parameters are no longer supported." },
        { "type": "code", "lines": [
          "GET /v2/orders?cursor=eyJpZCI6NTB9&limit=50",
          "X-Api-Version: 2",
          "",
          "200 OK",
          "{ \"data\": [ ... ], \"next_cursor\": \"eyJpZCI6MTAwfQ\" }"
        ] },
        { "type": "h2", "text": "2. Field changes" },
        { "type": "table", "headers": ["v1", "v2", "Note"], "rows": [
          ["customer_name", "customer_full_name", "Full name"],
          ["amount", "amount_minor", "!Now in cents"],
          ["created", "created_at", "ISO 8601 with zone"]
        ] },
        { "type": "p", "text": "The amount_minor field changes the unit. Clients that only rename the field will charge 100 times the correct amount." }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-doc-2", "name": "Billing architecture (RFC).pdf", "kind": "RFC", "color": "#A142F4",
      "pages": 18, "size": "1.1 MB", "updated": "yesterday, 17:40",
      "scanned": false, "signed": false, "filled": false, "redacted": false, "ocr": false, "annotated": false,
      "summary": [
        "Proposal to move billing to event sourcing.",
        "Main argument: a complete change history and easier audits.",
        "Risk: a more complex migration of existing data.",
        "The decision will be made at the architecture meeting on Wednesday."
      ],
      "changes": [],
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "letterhead", "org": "Nimbus Labs", "sub": "RFC-0142 · Architecture" },
        { "type": "title", "text": "Event sourcing for the billing service" },
        { "type": "meta", "items": [
          { "label": "Authors", "value": "I. Kostić, M. Petrović" },
          { "label": "Status", "value": "Proposal" },
          { "label": "Reviewers", "value": "L. Đorđević, P. Ristić" },
          { "label": "Comments due", "value": "11 November" }
        ] },
        { "type": "h2", "text": "Context" },
        { "type": "p", "text": "Today the billing service stores only the current state of each invoice. When a customer disputes an amount, rebuilding the history means reading logs by hand and takes days." },
        { "type": "h2", "text": "Proposal" },
        { "type": "p", "text": "Every change becomes an immutable event in the log. The current invoice state is built from events, and projections are refreshed asynchronously." },
        { "type": "code", "lines": [
          "InvoiceCreated   { id, customer, lines }",
          "LineAdjusted     { id, line, delta_minor }",
          "InvoicePaid      { id, paid_at, method }"
        ] },
        { "type": "h2", "text": "Risks" },
        { "type": "p", "text": "Migrating the existing 2.3 million invoices, and dual writes during the transition period." }
      ]
    },
